Modifications made in this project:

  * the ISP command layer of NuvoISP/ISPLdCMD.cpp was re-implemented in
    Python (meraki_flasher/isp.py, meraki_flasher/protocol.py);
  * the device emulator, session layer, CLI and Tkinter GUI are new work;
  * the packet framing, checksum algorithm, command codes, chunk sizes and
    retry/resend behaviour follow the upstream implementation so that the
    tool is wire-compatible with NuvoISP 4.13.

